{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38534","headline":"滻水席上献座主侍郎 · 吴融","name":"滻水席上献座主侍郎","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"暖泉宫里告虔回，略避红尘小宴开。\n落絮已随流水去，啼莺还傍夕阳来。\n草能缘岸侵罗荐，花不容枝蘸玉杯。\n莫讶诸生中独醉，感恩伤别正难裁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吴融","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38534.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38534","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}